From 0747b29ebd90676aaf5c70e1c153f50a99095742 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <claude@anthropic.com>
Date: Tue, 25 Aug 2026 13:13:24 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Add public shareable Yatra links and dynamic OG images

- yatra_plans.is_public column + RLS policies (0007_yatra_sharing.sql)
- PATCH /api/yatra-plans toggles is_public, owner-scoped
- ShareYatraButton: share/copy-link/unshare UI on the owner's Yatra page
- /yatra/[id]: public, auth-free, view-only itinerary page
- opengraph-image.tsx for /temples/[slug] and /yatra/[id] (next/og)
- generateMetadata on /temples/[slug] so OG title/description are per-temple
- metadataBase in root layout so OG image URLs resolve correctly
